From ea26fe8dee807a89a1128ca2d1bccecd8d8f9ae4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard <richtestani@mac.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:22:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Formatted text: inline markdown in titles and body paragraphs

Titles, subtitles, CTA/contact text and body paragraphs now accept
**bold**, *italic*, `code`, [links](/path) and ==highlight== (accent
color, for two-tone titles). Body paragraphs starting with a list or
quote marker render as block markdown. Internal links route through
vue-router; external links open in a new tab. Raw HTML is disabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019m8fUeYBqr1dYU2BpC7DPn
